WEBVTT

01:32.644 --> 01:35.258
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.282 --> 01:37.896
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:38.050 --> 01:40.926
(Episode 3)

01:48.418 --> 01:49.418
(Door is open.)

01:49.578 --> 01:50.578
(Please come in.)

01:51.042 --> 01:53.081
You go first. I'll go after you.

02:01.682 --> 02:02.682
Mum.

02:03.762 --> 02:04.881
We're back.

02:11.042 --> 02:13.121
How did you two end up coming home together?

02:13.602 --> 02:14.722
We ran into each other at the entrance.

02:14.842 --> 02:15.858
Where is Dad?

02:15.882 --> 02:17.042
He's gone to Xiao Xiao's place.

02:17.401 --> 02:19.401
I reckon he'll stay there for dinner.

02:20.762 --> 02:22.080
I broke a sweat in the car just now.

02:22.081 --> 02:23.202
I need to get changed.

02:25.442 --> 02:26.442
I'm going upstairs as well.

03:18.322 --> 03:19.322
Hurry up.

03:56.282 --> 03:57.282
Mum.

03:58.641 --> 03:59.681
Where is my wood carving?

04:00.162 --> 04:01.561
I told the cleaner to get rid of it.

04:02.282 --> 04:03.282
Why?

04:03.602 --> 04:05.081
I have told you before

04:05.241 --> 04:07.282
that I don't like it when you mess around with those things.

04:07.322 --> 04:09.442
I can't stand it when the floor is covered in wood shavings.

04:09.482 --> 04:11.761
I'm sure you can find a better hobby.

04:11.762 --> 04:13.641
-Mum, Qin Qin... -I don't like

04:13.961 --> 04:15.121
that you're a doctor either.

04:16.002 --> 04:17.200
Not only it's an underappreciated job that requires a lot of effort,

04:17.201 --> 04:18.402
you're often required to work overtime too.

04:19.042 --> 04:20.241
What will happen when you have a family?

04:20.482 --> 04:21.922
Who's going to take care of your family?

04:22.402 --> 04:23.402
Mum.

04:26.422 --> 04:27.498
Aunt.

04:27.522 --> 04:28.522
Xiao Xiao, you're here.

04:28.761 --> 04:29.761
I'm here to get free dinner.

04:31.962 --> 04:34.121
No problem. Go ahead and have a nice chat.

04:42.842 --> 04:43.938
What's wrong?

04:43.962 --> 04:45.241
Did anyone get scolding again?

05:14.842 --> 05:16.201
It's break time. Let's grab some food.

05:16.241 --> 05:17.681
Sure.

05:22.201 --> 05:23.201
Jiang!

05:23.441 --> 05:24.441
Captain.

05:26.881 --> 05:27.922
Who's in charge of disposing the rubbish today?

05:28.321 --> 05:29.441
Da Peng is on duty today.

05:29.881 --> 05:31.441
I saw him go downstairs to take out the trash.

05:32.121 --> 05:33.321
Did anything go missing? Is it something important?

05:33.561 --> 05:34.561
I'll help you look for it.

05:35.121 --> 05:36.121
I'm just asking.

05:36.761 --> 05:37.842
Alright, it's fine.

05:38.082 --> 05:39.082
You may leave now.

05:45.722 --> 05:47.120
If you decide to change your cook,

05:47.121 --> 05:48.761
make sure you inform me beforehand. I'll hire him for sure.

05:49.642 --> 05:50.642
My mum is here.

05:53.561 --> 05:54.642
You gave me a shock.

05:55.441 --> 05:56.681
Aren't you the one who's most afraid of her?

05:57.681 --> 05:58.881
I recently opened a new bar.

05:59.082 --> 06:01.201
Come to my place tomorrow. You guys need to chill and relax.

06:03.962 --> 06:04.962
Mum.

06:05.201 --> 06:06.201
Not again!

06:07.001 --> 06:08.082
Don't even think that you can scare me again.

06:08.522 --> 06:09.881
It's undeniable that my aunt is a troublemaker,

06:10.561 --> 06:12.402
but she's adorable anyway. Am I right?

06:12.602 --> 06:15.361
I was telling them that I've missed you as I haven't seen you for days.

06:16.761 --> 06:17.761
Here.

06:19.922 --> 06:21.282
You guys are not observant at all.

06:22.482 --> 06:23.482
Take a seat.

06:29.561 --> 06:30.561
Yan Chen,

06:31.201 --> 06:32.561
you should learn from Xiao Xiao

06:33.162 --> 06:34.722
and get yourself a partner soon.

06:35.881 --> 06:37.681
You grew up together.

06:38.001 --> 06:39.761
You should become a good influence on him.

06:41.001 --> 06:42.440
What if he takes my advice

06:42.441 --> 06:44.162
but ends up becoming a couple with someone you dislike?

06:44.922 --> 06:46.360
Of course, if she's not good, then she's not acceptable.

06:46.361 --> 06:48.642
If that's the case, you need to define what's good and what's not.

06:48.761 --> 06:49.761
First and foremost,

06:50.441 --> 06:52.441
never marry someone who's unequal in social status.

06:53.201 --> 06:54.201
That's a big no.

06:55.321 --> 06:56.321
Here.

06:56.962 --> 06:57.962
This is for you.

06:59.761 --> 07:00.761
And this...

07:01.842 --> 07:02.880
Why did they receive presents from you?

07:02.881 --> 07:03.881
Where's mine?

07:04.402 --> 07:05.402
You don't need it.

07:06.001 --> 07:07.001
Those are

07:07.522 --> 07:09.321
a few ladies that I chose for you.

07:09.801 --> 07:12.201
And those are a few guys that I chose for you.

07:13.001 --> 07:14.282
Take a look

07:14.561 --> 07:15.561
and let me know

07:16.001 --> 07:17.361
if you set your eyes on any of them.

07:17.642 --> 07:19.042
Don't forget to let me know.

07:19.162 --> 07:20.162
Okay?

07:20.761 --> 07:21.761
Got it.

07:22.121 --> 07:23.121
Let's eat.

07:30.402 --> 07:31.681
I don't want to bring this up

07:32.642 --> 07:34.482
but you two should come home more often.

07:34.722 --> 07:36.482
It's a big house, yet it's so quiet.

07:37.082 --> 07:38.082
Am I right?

07:48.962 --> 07:49.962
Moreover,

07:50.681 --> 07:52.082
you work at the hospital for long hours.

07:52.642 --> 07:53.657
That must have taken a toll on you.

07:53.681 --> 07:54.801
Come to my bar when you're free.

07:54.842 --> 07:56.201
I'll get you a bottle of good wine.

07:56.642 --> 07:57.642
And you.

07:57.761 --> 07:59.001
You should come along.

08:00.441 --> 08:02.482
Apparently, your mum is trying to get you a partner.

08:02.642 --> 08:04.681
Come to my bar. You can find pretty ladies there.

08:04.722 --> 08:05.881
-I can hook you up with them. -Xiao Xiao.

08:09.482 --> 08:10.681
Keep quiet

08:11.201 --> 08:12.201
when you're eating.

08:41.522 --> 08:42.561
What are you looking for?

08:46.402 --> 08:47.402
A lighter.

08:50.441 --> 08:51.441
You mean, the present she got you?

08:56.441 --> 08:58.402
You carried it everywhere for the past ten years.

08:59.042 --> 09:00.242
Since you care about her so much,

09:00.961 --> 09:02.042
why did you break up with her in the first place?

09:25.642 --> 09:27.122
There's a huge gap

09:27.601 --> 09:28.762
between our families.

09:29.561 --> 09:31.362
Her parents put great emphasis on social status and family background.

09:33.642 --> 09:34.642
They think that I'm not well-matched with their daughter.

09:37.522 --> 09:39.242
I think I understand that.

09:40.201 --> 09:42.002
You've been really harsh on yourself all these years.

09:42.642 --> 09:44.242
You always want to be the first in everything.

09:44.522 --> 09:46.601
You care so much about the honour and mission on your shoulders.

09:47.042 --> 09:48.841
I bet she's part of the reason.

09:52.321 --> 09:54.362
I want to bring us closer together.

09:55.201 --> 09:56.721
I have fantasized before

09:57.321 --> 09:58.402
that one day soon,

09:59.081 --> 10:00.481
if I meet her again,

10:02.642 --> 10:04.201
I wish I could

10:04.841 --> 10:06.201
stand proudly in front of her.

10:11.321 --> 10:12.321
I'm alright.

10:13.922 --> 10:15.081
For the past ten years,

10:18.362 --> 10:20.042
I have been keeping it with me.

10:23.002 --> 10:24.282
Don't you think it's weird?

10:25.721 --> 10:26.721
She's here

10:28.122 --> 10:29.321
but I misplaced the item.

10:33.201 --> 10:34.441
For some reasons,

10:35.162 --> 10:36.162
I feel empty inside.

10:43.601 --> 10:46.122
I don't know what exactly happened between you two

10:46.801 --> 10:48.242
but I can tell

10:49.362 --> 10:50.601
that you're badly hurt

10:50.762 --> 10:51.961
in that relationship.

10:54.601 --> 10:55.801
You've met her anyway.

10:56.242 --> 10:57.440
Since you don't want to bring up the past again,

10:57.441 --> 10:59.362
you should let go of the past.

11:00.081 --> 11:02.321
If something is lost, there's no need to search for it again.

11:03.242 --> 11:04.600
If you missed out on someone,

11:04.601 --> 11:05.801
there's no need to go back.

11:06.201 --> 11:07.762
Don't live in the past.

11:12.242 --> 11:14.002
Perhaps that's a sign from God

11:14.441 --> 11:15.601
for you let go of the past

11:16.402 --> 11:17.522
and start a new life.

11:36.321 --> 11:37.522
I need some advice.

11:45.122 --> 11:46.362
All of them look good.

11:46.522 --> 11:47.522
Don't you think

11:48.081 --> 11:49.601
all of them look alike?

11:50.362 --> 11:51.922
All their facial features appear to have been meticulously refined.

11:53.922 --> 11:55.242
They're no match for you.

12:03.841 --> 12:04.922
Jiang Yu?

12:05.242 --> 12:06.242
He's a decent guy.

12:06.441 --> 12:07.441
He's reliable.

12:08.122 --> 12:09.162
In comparison to Song...

12:10.242 --> 12:11.242
He's way better.

12:13.762 --> 12:14.762
What's wrong?

12:15.242 --> 12:16.642
Am I not allowed to share my view?

12:17.201 --> 12:18.481
I'm merely speaking the truth.

12:19.441 --> 12:20.481
You are not compatible with him.

12:20.721 --> 12:21.721
Your relationship won't work out.

12:21.841 --> 12:23.242
We always look at the past

12:23.642 --> 12:25.042
through rose-tinted glasses.

12:25.601 --> 12:27.402
In fact, you're not in love with him.

12:27.601 --> 12:29.522
You merely have regrets about the past.

12:29.841 --> 12:30.841
It's human nature

12:31.481 --> 12:33.162
that what we can't get is always the best.

12:37.961 --> 12:39.121
It's getting late. Where are you going?

12:39.122 --> 12:40.122
I'm going to bar.

12:56.122 --> 12:57.361
Welcome to the bar, pretty doctor.

12:57.362 --> 12:59.362
The bar owner is here to receive you personally.

12:59.481 --> 13:01.368
You'd better save the effort to coax your girlfriend instead.

13:01.522 --> 13:03.402
-You're my one and only girlfriend. -Get off.

13:04.321 --> 13:05.642
It hurts.

13:06.642 --> 13:08.008
She's rude. You should educate her.

13:08.481 --> 13:09.481
Stop talking nonsense.

13:09.482 --> 13:10.641
Show us around.

13:10.642 --> 13:12.642
Sure. Mr Meng, this way please.

13:13.214 --> 13:14.349
Come on.

13:15.083 --> 13:16.443
What do you think? Is the bar okay?

13:16.601 --> 13:17.601
Boss.

13:17.841 --> 13:19.402
Bring me three glasses of Yamazaki 25.

13:19.601 --> 13:21.242
-Sure. -Take a seat.

13:21.882 --> 13:22.882
Here, Qin.

13:23.961 --> 13:24.961
Take a seat.

13:27.381 --> 13:28.401
I bought two floors in total.

13:28.402 --> 13:29.761
The upper floor is always crowded.

13:29.762 --> 13:31.522
This floor, on the other hand, is slightly quieter.

13:31.961 --> 13:33.042
The view is not bad, right?

13:34.402 --> 13:35.402
It's not bad, indeed.

13:35.762 --> 13:37.841
I didn't expect that you actually have good taste.

13:38.441 --> 13:39.773
I learned from you.

13:42.402 --> 13:44.402
Qin, you can come here whenever you're free.

13:58.721 --> 13:59.721
What's wrong with you?

13:59.882 --> 14:00.882
Are you newbie?

14:01.282 --> 14:02.601
Haven't you received any training before?

14:03.721 --> 14:05.978
Boss, she's newly hired. I'm truly sorry for the accident.

14:06.002 --> 14:07.002
Apologize to them. Hurry.

14:07.642 --> 14:08.642
I'm sorry.

14:09.042 --> 14:10.042
It's alright.

14:10.242 --> 14:12.561
She's just a part-timer. I'll definitely knock some sense into her head later.

14:20.056 --> 14:21.400
Thorough training and proper guidance

14:21.424 --> 14:22.737
is very important, especially to the part-timers.

14:22.762 --> 14:24.480
You're not doing a good job. Are you aware of that?

14:24.481 --> 14:25.953
I'm sorry. I'll be more alert moving forward.

14:28.762 --> 14:30.122
The fire department will come for an inspection later.

14:30.201 --> 14:31.201
Please handle the reception.

14:31.441 --> 14:32.441
Be polite to them.

14:32.642 --> 14:34.522
Sure. I'm getting back to work.

14:35.762 --> 14:36.882
You're pretty strict at work.

14:37.841 --> 14:39.282
Is that just a show in front of us?

14:40.762 --> 14:43.801
I am serious and dedicated when it comes to my work, alright?

14:44.721 --> 14:45.762
I need to make a call.

14:50.681 --> 14:52.162
It's not easy to hire workers these days.

15:04.122 --> 15:05.122
I'm sorry.

15:13.841 --> 15:16.321
Do you think she looks like Qin?

15:16.882 --> 15:17.882
Does she?

15:18.481 --> 15:19.762
I think they look alike.

15:38.522 --> 15:41.001
Do you conduct regular inspections of fire safety facilities here?

15:41.002 --> 15:42.002
We do.

15:42.402 --> 15:44.321
If there are any issues, remember to replace them promptly.

15:44.601 --> 15:45.961
Sure. Don't worry.

15:46.002 --> 15:47.641
We'll definitely strictly adhere to the regulations.

15:47.642 --> 15:50.282
Hello. Are you from the fire department?

15:51.722 --> 15:52.817
Yes.

15:52.841 --> 15:55.882
Fire inspections are typically conducted by firefighters, aren't they?

15:56.441 --> 15:58.080
Fire inspections are under the jurisdiction of the fire brigade.

15:58.081 --> 15:59.601
Firefighters belong to Fire and Rescue Station.

15:59.762 --> 16:01.002
They are not in charge of inspections.

16:02.642 --> 16:03.762
Show us the way to the emergency exit.

16:03.882 --> 16:05.242
Sure. This way please.

16:30.441 --> 16:31.441
What are you thinking?

16:34.081 --> 16:35.162
Two days ago,

16:35.402 --> 16:36.441
I ran into Song Yan.

16:38.321 --> 16:39.321
What does he do for a living?

16:39.601 --> 16:40.601
Wait. Let me take a guess.

16:41.002 --> 16:42.882
Don't tell me he's self-employed, just like me.

16:43.441 --> 16:44.601
He's a firefighter.

16:47.402 --> 16:48.402
Then what?

16:48.681 --> 16:49.922
I bet you chatted and reminisced the old times together.

16:50.282 --> 16:51.362
How did the conversation go?

16:54.242 --> 16:55.402
He didn't really want to talk to me.

16:57.762 --> 16:58.841
So you feel a sense of regret?

17:00.922 --> 17:02.002
So what if I regret?

17:02.642 --> 17:03.841
There's nothing I can do.

17:05.001 --> 17:06.721
Life is full of regrets.

17:07.642 --> 17:09.802
Even if people try their best and strive with all their might,

17:10.481 --> 17:11.602
as if they've lost their mind,

17:12.082 --> 17:13.082
in the end,

17:15.322 --> 17:16.961
no one can escape from difficulties.

17:17.922 --> 17:19.362
So many years have passed.

17:20.001 --> 17:21.281
I can't believe that you're still smitten with him.

17:23.521 --> 17:25.001
I thought I was no longer in love with him.

17:32.082 --> 17:34.041
Things got out of hand once you reunited with him.

17:34.201 --> 17:36.441
It seems that your feelings for him flared up again.

17:37.001 --> 17:39.041
It shows that you have never forgotten about him.

17:39.802 --> 17:40.802
Qin,

17:41.001 --> 17:42.601
the most tormenting thing in this world

17:42.602 --> 17:44.081
is to refuse to move on,

17:44.082 --> 17:45.281
thinking that you can go back.

17:45.322 --> 17:46.802
I have heard about the story between the two of you.

17:46.961 --> 17:48.402
I don't mean to be rude

17:49.041 --> 17:50.082
but if it's impossible in the past,

17:50.402 --> 17:51.402
it's even more

17:51.681 --> 17:52.681
impossible in the future.

17:54.681 --> 17:56.001
Cheer up. Don't think too much.

17:56.562 --> 17:57.562
Let's go.

17:57.761 --> 17:58.802
Let's grab some drinks.

17:59.201 --> 18:00.201
Go ahead.

18:00.521 --> 18:01.642
I need to wash my hands.

18:25.241 --> 18:26.241
No peeping.

18:52.281 --> 18:54.122
Qin, where are you going?

18:54.681 --> 18:56.721
Something came up at the hospital. I need to go now.

18:58.281 --> 18:59.681
Are you serious?

19:04.961 --> 19:05.961
Not only did Qin leave early,

19:06.122 --> 19:07.201
she also lied.

19:09.937 --> 19:10.976
What's wrong?

19:11.001 --> 19:12.562
Do you know what Qin told me just now?

19:13.241 --> 19:15.802
Life is full of regrets.

19:16.001 --> 19:19.001
Even if people try their best and strive with all their might,

19:19.201 --> 19:20.562
no one can escape from difficulties.

19:21.001 --> 19:22.882
No one in their right mind would say that.

19:29.041 --> 19:30.642
Life is short.

19:30.961 --> 19:34.122
Being able to enjoy pleasures is already a great blessing.

19:36.961 --> 19:38.241
Giving up what you already have

19:38.322 --> 19:40.122
to pursue something elusive and intangible

19:40.642 --> 19:41.642
is definitely not wise.

19:56.761 --> 19:58.241
-Hello. -Hello.

19:58.521 --> 20:00.721
May I know if Song Yan works here?

20:01.642 --> 20:02.922
May I know who are you?

20:03.122 --> 20:04.122
I am...

20:04.562 --> 20:05.680
I'm his former classmate.

20:05.681 --> 20:07.280
Can you help me get in touch with him?

20:07.281 --> 20:09.041
-Please wait a moment. -Thank you.

20:12.201 --> 20:13.280
Hello, is this Captain Song?

20:13.281 --> 20:14.440
Someone is looking for you.

20:14.441 --> 20:15.922
She claimed that she's your former classmate.

20:18.521 --> 20:19.761
May I know your name?

20:20.241 --> 20:21.241
Xu Qin.

20:21.842 --> 20:23.322
Her name is Xu Qin.

20:27.882 --> 20:29.082
Sure.

20:30.481 --> 20:33.322
I'm sorry. Captain Song is not in today.

20:34.162 --> 20:35.322
Where did he go?

20:35.441 --> 20:37.322
Chances are...

20:37.602 --> 20:39.162
He's gone outside for training.

20:42.001 --> 20:43.162
Thank you.

20:53.402 --> 20:54.882
-Li Cheng. -Yes, Staff Officer Li?

20:56.041 --> 20:58.721
I have a meeting with the detachment captain in a little while.

20:58.882 --> 21:01.241
Pass the dog food to Captain Song, alright?

21:01.402 --> 21:02.520
-Sure. -Thanks for your help.

21:02.521 --> 21:03.521
Don't mention it.

21:05.041 --> 21:06.161
Alright. You may get back to work.

21:06.162 --> 21:07.201
Take care.

21:52.961 --> 21:54.761
Just go ahead and meet her if you want.

22:01.761 --> 22:02.761
Meng.

22:03.201 --> 22:04.201
Good boy.

22:07.882 --> 22:10.001
You bond well with Meng.

22:10.761 --> 22:11.761
Don't state the obvious.

22:12.322 --> 22:13.402
I raised it.

22:16.001 --> 22:17.562
Dogs are loyal.

22:17.922 --> 22:18.922
Like owner, like dog.

22:19.642 --> 22:21.281
Why do I feel like you're implying something?

22:21.922 --> 22:23.241
I'm implying that you're loyal.

22:24.798 --> 22:25.767
Get lost.

22:26.933 --> 22:28.957
(Visitors must register, and please come forward to show your ID)

22:43.761 --> 22:44.761
Are you sure you don't want to see her?

22:46.402 --> 22:47.521
Why should I see her?

22:48.041 --> 22:49.322
She's not someone important.

23:35.961 --> 23:39.602
-I'll feed you with some yummy food. -Yummy.

23:41.761 --> 23:42.842
Finally you're back from work, Yan.

23:43.001 --> 23:44.641
Yan!

23:44.642 --> 23:48.000
When will you take us for a ride on fire truck?

23:48.001 --> 23:49.922
We want a ride on fire truck!

23:50.562 --> 23:52.040
I'll take you for a ride when you're slightly older.

23:52.041 --> 23:52.842
-Okay? -No way!

23:52.843 --> 23:56.280
We're grown-ups now.

23:56.281 --> 23:57.641
Hurry up. Come here.

23:57.642 --> 23:58.721
Stop disturbing Mr Song.

23:58.761 --> 23:59.761
Hurry.

24:00.521 --> 24:02.602
-Hello, Mr Zhao. -You're back from work.

24:04.001 --> 24:05.961
-Grandpa. -Leave Mr Song alone.

24:06.201 --> 24:08.001
-Let's play chess together. -This is for you.

24:08.481 --> 24:10.521
-Don't forget to thank Mr Song. -Thank you, Yan.

24:10.642 --> 24:11.802
Thank you, Yan.

24:11.961 --> 24:14.001
Yan is unbeatable!

24:15.982 --> 24:17.058
-Mr Zhao. -What?

24:17.082 --> 24:18.082
Well...

24:18.402 --> 24:21.641
-You're losing. -Exactly. That's why I need your help.

24:21.642 --> 24:24.241
-Yan, keep your words! -Sure!

24:25.402 --> 24:27.162
Aunt, I'm back.

24:27.562 --> 24:28.802
You're finally home!

24:29.122 --> 24:30.122
I bet you haven't eaten.

24:30.481 --> 24:31.481
Can I have some beef noodles?

24:32.481 --> 24:33.881
Sure. Come here.

24:33.882 --> 24:35.161
Why are you carrying so many things?

24:35.162 --> 24:36.642
-I bought some fruits. -Hurry.

24:45.362 --> 24:46.362
It's done.

24:48.241 --> 24:49.241
Here.

24:49.322 --> 24:50.642
Have some pickled vegetables.

24:50.882 --> 24:52.082
It's flavourful.

24:54.125 --> 24:55.162
Here you go.

24:59.441 --> 25:00.441
Is it delicious?

25:02.162 --> 25:03.481
I've missed the taste so badly.

25:09.322 --> 25:10.681
Xu Qin

25:11.562 --> 25:12.922
came here looking for you.

25:17.802 --> 25:19.041
It seems that you've met her.

25:21.082 --> 25:22.322
Are you still in love with her?

25:24.322 --> 25:25.760
I couldn't hate her enough.

25:25.761 --> 25:27.362
Hatred doesn't arise without love.

25:29.602 --> 25:30.721
I swear I hate her to the core.

25:31.162 --> 25:32.162
I feel annoyed just by seeing her.

25:32.402 --> 25:33.481
You swear?

25:40.201 --> 25:41.882
Finally I can stop worrying.

25:43.362 --> 25:44.362
Hear me out.

25:44.681 --> 25:46.480
A wise man does not dwell on the past.

25:46.481 --> 25:50.201
Don't forget how much hardship you went through because of her.

25:51.481 --> 25:53.361
I'm still angry thinking about it now.

25:53.362 --> 25:54.441
She's too much.

25:56.122 --> 25:57.922
How could she have gone so far?

25:58.082 --> 25:59.441
She even had the cheek to look for you.

26:00.241 --> 26:01.521
How brazen.

26:05.761 --> 26:07.281
Aunt, can I have some garlic?

26:08.562 --> 26:10.801
Is the pickled vegetables lacking in flavour? Why are you asking for garlic?

26:10.802 --> 26:12.801
My uncle used to tell me that eating noodles without garlic

26:12.802 --> 26:14.041
is like missing out on half of the taste.

26:14.241 --> 26:16.082
Alright. I'll get you some garlic right away.

26:30.481 --> 26:31.481
Relax.

26:31.562 --> 26:32.562
Calm down.

26:34.521 --> 26:36.082
Here, have some fruits.

26:36.162 --> 26:37.322
They're good for health.

26:37.961 --> 26:38.961
Thank you, Aunt.

26:39.001 --> 26:40.001
Don't mention it.

26:41.681 --> 26:44.521
She looks so beautiful.

26:49.882 --> 26:52.000
Make sure you take good care of her. Eat more fruits.

26:52.001 --> 26:53.882
Don't be shy. Eat more.

26:54.441 --> 26:55.441
She's truly beautiful.

27:01.082 --> 27:02.082
Is it sweet?

27:02.642 --> 27:03.642
Don't stop eating.

27:19.162 --> 27:22.041
My uncle and aunt are really nice.

27:23.241 --> 27:24.802
They won't skin you alive.

27:35.201 --> 27:36.882
Are you following me to the washroom?

27:40.402 --> 27:41.642
Let me show you something.

27:44.922 --> 27:45.922
There you go!

27:48.241 --> 27:49.241
One more!

27:52.642 --> 27:54.521
Song Yan, I love spending time at your place!

27:55.842 --> 27:56.842
Don't just say that for fun.

27:58.041 --> 27:59.681
I dare you to join our family legally.

28:00.961 --> 28:02.162
I, Song Yan, promise

28:02.322 --> 28:04.882
that I'll care about none others than you for the rest of my life.

28:05.681 --> 28:09.162
At this stage, you should focus on none other than your studies!

28:09.362 --> 28:11.040
Qin has enrolled into a great university

28:11.041 --> 28:12.161
and you're still re-attending classes.

28:12.162 --> 28:13.882
Be careful. She may ditch you soon.

28:16.521 --> 28:17.521
Will you ditch me soon?

28:19.602 --> 28:20.642
Will you ditch me soon?

28:22.281 --> 28:23.361
Will you really ditch me soon?

28:23.362 --> 28:24.761
-Will you really ditch me soon? -She'll ditch you for sure.

28:34.441 --> 28:36.802
-Your uncle and aunt are really nice. -Right?

28:36.961 --> 28:38.961
Your small courtyard at home is also very beautiful.

28:39.441 --> 28:42.362
If only I had a beautiful courtyard like yours at home.

28:42.441 --> 28:44.481
I would definitely stay at home every day and not go out.

29:01.521 --> 29:02.842
Eat it now, or it'll melt in no time.

29:07.322 --> 29:08.961
I don't like eating popsicle.

29:10.322 --> 29:11.642
It's not hygienic at all.

29:13.761 --> 29:15.642
Eating unhygienic food doesn't necessarily mean you'll get sick.

29:18.082 --> 29:19.082
Take it.

29:30.521 --> 29:31.922
How did your car end up there?

29:32.882 --> 29:33.882
We need to leave now.

29:34.001 --> 29:35.001
Song Yan.

29:40.721 --> 29:42.082
Don't come looking for me again in the future.

29:43.521 --> 29:47.162
I used to play with you because I found it exciting.

29:47.882 --> 29:49.402
I've thought it through.

29:50.082 --> 29:52.362
We were never meant to be together in the first place.

29:53.041 --> 29:54.761
We won't have any intersections in the future either.

29:55.602 --> 29:56.922
If you continue fooling around,

29:58.201 --> 30:00.162
you won't succeed in life in the future.

30:06.642 --> 30:07.642
Xu Qin,

30:09.122 --> 30:10.761
is your family against our relationship?

30:16.402 --> 30:17.602
No one is against it.

30:18.281 --> 30:20.001
I don't want to lie to you anymore.

30:21.001 --> 30:22.342
Once the novelty wears off,

30:23.362 --> 30:24.521
it becomes boring.

30:24.961 --> 30:26.082
Tell me the truth.

30:26.322 --> 30:27.641
Did your parents force you to say this?

30:27.642 --> 30:29.082
No one forced me.

30:30.201 --> 30:31.681
Your place is run-down and dilapidated.

30:34.281 --> 30:35.882
I don't like your place at all.

30:42.041 --> 30:43.441
Stop contacting me.

31:06.201 --> 31:07.201
Xu Qin!

31:08.241 --> 31:09.241
Xu Qin!

31:09.281 --> 31:10.281
Stop! Xu Qin!

32:16.155 --> 32:20.442
(I want to talk to you. I'll be waiting for you in the woods.)

33:10.241 --> 33:11.241
Deputy Dean Liu.

33:12.001 --> 33:13.761
Xu Qin, are you off work?

33:14.721 --> 33:17.122
How are you adapting to the hospital lately?

33:18.041 --> 33:19.201
I'm doing pretty well.

33:19.241 --> 33:21.081
Great. If you need any help,

33:21.082 --> 33:22.322
come to me directly. I'll sort it out for you.

33:22.802 --> 33:24.001
Don't worry. Everything is going well.

33:24.241 --> 33:25.241
That's great.

33:25.441 --> 33:27.562
I ran into your mother two days ago.

33:27.922 --> 33:29.122
Please send her my regards.

33:29.225 --> 33:30.138
-Sure. -Great.

33:30.162 --> 33:31.162
Since you're off work...

33:32.082 --> 33:33.802
-Xu... -Dr Xu.

33:37.281 --> 33:39.562
He walks around with a long face every day, as if someone owes him money.

33:39.681 --> 33:40.681
He's terrible.

33:43.122 --> 33:44.561
Deputy Dean Liu, I'm taking my leave.

33:44.562 --> 33:47.001
-Sure. Take care. -Sure.

33:53.201 --> 33:55.402
(A red alert for heavy rain has been issued.)

33:55.602 --> 33:57.601
(From tonight until early tomorrow morning, )

33:57.602 --> 33:59.802
(there will be extremely heavy rainfall throughout the city.)

33:59.961 --> 34:02.122
(Citizens are advised to prioritize safety when travelling.)

34:02.281 --> 34:04.842
(Production units are advised to take precautionary measures in advance)

34:04.882 --> 34:06.721
(to prevent any loss of property or assets.)

34:06.922 --> 34:08.681
Ge, come down!

34:09.002 --> 34:10.080
It's pouring.

34:10.081 --> 34:12.121
Today's training concludes here.

34:14.242 --> 34:15.842
Tong Ming, keep the ladder away!

34:16.521 --> 34:17.722
Check the flood control equipment.

34:32.362 --> 34:33.922
Thoroughly inspect all the equipment.

34:34.001 --> 34:35.681
We can start loading the vehicles once the clean-up is almost finished.

34:35.682 --> 34:36.682
Sure.

34:37.682 --> 34:39.402
Bring the kayak over here for inspections.

34:41.242 --> 34:43.921
Instructor, rainy weather can help reduce the risk of fire, right?

34:43.922 --> 34:44.922
Why are you so nervous?

34:45.041 --> 34:46.121
Sometimes, rain

34:46.481 --> 34:47.601
can be more troublesome than a fire situation.

34:48.121 --> 34:50.001
Hurry up and go change your clothes. Don't catch a cold.

34:50.161 --> 34:51.722
-Sure. -Noted.

35:02.202 --> 35:03.202
Hello?

35:05.362 --> 35:07.440
I have a feeling that your day off might be...

35:07.441 --> 35:08.441
(Got it.)

35:08.521 --> 35:09.521
(I have already returned to the team.)

35:19.041 --> 35:20.041
I didn't see this coming.

35:20.282 --> 35:22.842
Your holiday is over just as it has started.

35:24.961 --> 35:26.282
The night has just begun.

35:33.802 --> 35:34.802
Hello, Dr Xu.

35:35.561 --> 35:36.961
There are many emergency cases due to the heavy rain disaster.

35:37.242 --> 35:38.682
Dr Xu said that all staff members should report to duty.

35:39.041 --> 35:40.202
Alright. Got it.

36:53.032 --> 36:54.050
(119)

36:58.402 --> 37:00.041
Hello, is this 119?

37:00.121 --> 37:01.441
(Hello, this is 119. Please speak.)

37:01.641 --> 37:02.721
My car has been flooded.

37:02.722 --> 37:04.161
I'm unable to open the door.

37:05.202 --> 37:06.440
There is no window breaker in the car.

37:06.441 --> 37:07.561
I can't get out.

37:07.642 --> 37:08.738
(Don't panic.)

37:08.762 --> 37:10.121
(Could you please provide your exact location?)

37:11.441 --> 37:13.282
I'm at the Songmen Bridge underpass.

37:13.585 --> 37:15.841
(Noted. We have firefighters near your location.)

37:15.842 --> 37:16.842
(Notification has been sent to them.)

37:17.001 --> 37:18.362
(Please keep your phone line open.)

37:48.481 --> 37:49.762
Help!

37:49.842 --> 37:51.402
Help!

37:54.802 --> 37:55.842
Help!

38:02.922 --> 38:04.481
Help!

38:04.603 --> 38:05.874
Help!

38:15.882 --> 38:18.041
Help!

38:21.001 --> 38:22.682
Help!

38:36.722 --> 38:38.922
I'm here!

38:40.002 --> 38:41.097
I'm here!

38:41.121 --> 38:43.842
Help!

38:49.601 --> 38:50.722
I'm here!

38:51.362 --> 38:53.552
Help!

39:01.322 --> 39:03.202
I'm here!

39:09.041 --> 39:11.040
Captain Song, the water here is too deep.

39:11.041 --> 39:12.041
Slow down!

39:23.402 --> 39:25.882
Captain Song, I'll go to the back and help lift the car.

40:43.402 --> 40:44.441
Come out!

41:18.001 --> 41:19.001
Let go of me.

41:23.882 --> 41:25.521
Believe it or not, I'll throw you into the water.

41:30.882 --> 41:32.001
Bring me the clothes!

41:34.802 --> 41:37.216
Do you know how many accidents occur

41:37.441 --> 41:38.722
within a five-kilometre radius in the past one hour?

41:39.582 --> 41:40.640
The Red Rainstorm Signal has been declared.

41:40.641 --> 41:41.641
Why didn't you stay at home?

41:41.722 --> 41:42.722
What on earth are you doing here?

41:43.242 --> 41:45.242
The hospital has called us back on urgent basis.

41:47.362 --> 41:48.362
Captain Song.

41:49.441 --> 41:50.601
Find a place to take shelter from the rain!

41:52.682 --> 41:54.001
Did you try so hard because you knew that I was in the car?

41:54.041 --> 41:55.041
It was so dangerous.

41:58.802 --> 42:00.802
I would have done the same to rescue a dog that's trapped in the car.
